Beside its data and analytical layers, DigiKat has a third, less visible layer — the **agentic** one. Part of the development work (writing code, quality checks, preparing pages) is done with the help of AI agents, but not free-hand. This page breaks down what that layer is made of and how it is bound together; a brief summary lives in the project's [executive overview](izvrsni-pregled.html) (in Croatian).

